{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/10/27/8592366/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかのお陰でドナヒューと再会できたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/10/27/8592366/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"潔子先輩と谷地ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この梨花さんめちゃめちゃタイプ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きです。\nめっっっちゃタイプっっ！！って叫びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おセクシーでかつ、とてもとても潔子さんです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/10/27/8592366/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くぼちゃんのほっぺたがすべすべすぎてとてもとても食べたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/10/27/8592366/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜髪の毛伸ばしたい、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金髪にしたい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝て起きたらこうなってないかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェーブかかったかわいい髪の毛になってないかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDTVご視聴ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"某美容クリニックのドクターをイメージしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな言葉は情熱です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週のらじらー久しぶりに出るよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん〜(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジさーん(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ★彡"}],"source":"archive"}